00:46:44.400 --> 00:46:45.520
Let go of mother!


00:46:53.680 --> 00:46:55.560
There's something very wrong with
both of you.


00:46:57.560 --> 00:47:00.040
Are you crazy!
-Rakel?


00:47:00.240 --> 00:47:01.280
I hate you!


00:47:03.600 --> 00:47:05.360
